WEBVTT

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.970
Now, everything changes!

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.770
My own fate...

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:18.980
...Kakarrot's fate...

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:24.940
...as well as your fate!

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.120
Having learned that Freeza
planned to wipe out all Saiyans,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.790
together with the planet Vegeta,

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:49.380
Son Goku's father Burdock
resolutely stood alone to challenge Freeza.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.220
While, at that same moment,

00:00:56.310 --> 00:01:03.690
a space pod carrying the
newly-born lower-class warrior Son Goku

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:07.570
was being launched toward Earth.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.910
This is where it ends!

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.500
W-what!?

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:41.310
That's the end of the Saiyans, huh?

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.360
Yeah. That's just like Freeza-sama.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.900
What's that capsule?
Confirmation on the monitor!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.410
Well if it isn't a Saiyan brat!

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.000
He's headed for a planet
named Earth, quite far from here.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:04.170
Shall I shoot it down?

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.630
--Yeah.
--Let it be.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.300
This zone is entrusted to Freeza.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:13.930
This is a seed he planted himself.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:15.680
Let him harvest it himself.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:22.810
We still have to subjugate seven
more worlds before the day is out.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:32.610
However, even though it's a baby,
for him to let even one Saiyan go...

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:38.200
The plan to exterminate the
Saiyans and take control of this district

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:41.250
being delayed is all due
to Freeza's arrogant conceit!

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:49.130
Freeza is still much, much too soft.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:29.630
Break through the shining
clouds, and fly away, (fly away)

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:36.760
As a panorama spreads
itself throughout my being

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:42.100
The Earth, having been kicked
in the face, gets angry, (angry)

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:48.770
And makes one of its volcanoes explode!

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:55.320
If, within the thawed polar ice,

00:03:55.400 --> 00:04:04.200
there is a dinosaur, then I want
to train him to balance atop a ball

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:07.960
CHA-LA HEAD CHA-LA

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:16.880
No matter what may happen, I feel
as though nothing can bother me,

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:20.180
CHA-LA HEAD CHA-LA

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:26.100
However hard your chest pounds,
the Genki Dama will roar!

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:29.730
CHA-LA HEAD CHA-LA

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:38.650
The emptier your head is, the more
room there is to pack with dreams,

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:42.120
CHA-LA HEAD CHA-LA

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:49.170
With a cheerful face and an Ultra-Z,
today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai...

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.250
Sparking!

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:14.320
Goku! That's enough of your training!

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:17.650
No, Old-timer, I still have more to go!

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:27.830
Goku has gotten even stronger
since he returned from Planet Namek.

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:40.300
Um, this goes like this...

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:46.470
Gohan-chan, you're hangin' in there, huh?

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.480
Ah, you've come again, have you?

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.190
No you don't! Gohan-chan is...

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:55.440
Haiya Dragon!
Don't go disturbing Gohan's homework!

00:05:57.030 --> 00:06:02.030
Did Goku-sa actually say not
to disturb your homework?

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.910
Goku-sa!
Are you runnin' a fever or somethin'!?

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:07.910
No, I ain't got a fever!

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.910
Naw, Goku-sa,
I'm sure you must not be feelin' right!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.330
That ain't it, I tell you!
Gohan, hurry up with that!

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:19.510
This is definitely strange!
For Goku-sa to tell you to study...

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:23.050
Yet he's never once
said anythin' like it before!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:31.680
You don't suppose Goku-sa's
gone funny from fightin' too much?

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:36.940
That's it! That's gotta be it!

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:43.490
Goku-sa has finally...

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.910
I- it can't be...

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.500
Gohan! Stick with that homework!

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:54.500
Goku-sa...

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:57.000
...please, snap out of it!

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:58.460
Goku-sa!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:03.510
Gohan!
Hurry and finish, and we'll go camping!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.550
Chichi, what are you doing?

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:11.310
So that's it, huh? I was a fool for worryin'.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.390
Hm? Gohan, hurry and finish that!

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.480
We can't keep everyone waiting.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.020
Everyone?

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.320
Hi there!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.360
Goku-sa, of all the...

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.910
Between campin' and studyin',
which is more important?

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.700
I- isn't it obvious!?

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:35.750
The answer is camping!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:57.900
What!? Freeza, who carries our glorious
bloodline, was killed by a low-life Saiyan!?

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.900
Y- yes. It is difficult to believe,

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:06.900
but a Saiyan who comes from Earth,
named Son Goku or something, has beaten him.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:09.570
Freeza, you damned fool!

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:14.200
I always knew you were soft, but
to be beaten by a mere monkey?

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.710
Don't tell me he's a Super Saiyan...

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.920
--Sauzer!
--Yes?

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:27.340
We leave for Earth immediately!

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:31.510
I will eradicate the Saiyan,
and utterly destroy the planet!

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.100
As I did this world!

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.320
Smells good!

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:54.490
Curry really is best when camping!

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:58.210
All that's left is to fry up the
fish that Goku will be bringing back.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.920
Gohan, some firewood, if you please.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.960
Right!

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:07.510
Up you go... there!

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:39.040
With one this huge, we'll be okay,
even with Oolong's giant stomach!

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:46.380
Here, Kuririn-san!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.260
Yeah, set it down there for me.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.590
What was that?

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:56.930
Hey, what? What is it?

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.400
Gohan!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.700
Kuri-

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:20.870
-san...

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:28.340
This is a Super Saiyan?

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:31.510
His battle power is only 50.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:35.470
Even if you discount the fact that Dore is
grabbing his tail, that's a pathetic reading.

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.890
Hey, hey, hey!

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.560
Unh, what are you doing!?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:44.900
Let's get out of here, now!

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.480
Hey, stop! Cut it out!

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.730
Hold it!

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.650
Who are you!?

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:57.320
I'm Son Goku! Let go of my Gohan!

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:01.700
Son Goku? That means you're
the one who beat Freeza-sama?

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:05.040
So, you're the one?

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:09.340
No great battle power here.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:13.010
He probably raises
his battle power momentarily.

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:16.340
We'll know soon enough once we test him.

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.890
Who are you guys?

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.640
The Coola Armored Corps!!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:25.060
Gohan! See to Kuririn!

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:28.610
Father!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.330
Kuririn-san! Kuririn-san!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.160
Hmph, not too bad.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:01.100
You monkey scum!

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.020
You idiot!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.320
It's because you weren't holding on tight-!

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.330
Startle me, will you!?

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.750
C- Coola-sama!

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:43.510
Freeza!?

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.020
Father!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.560
Stay back, Gohan!

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:57.570
All of the Saiyans are to be killed!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:01.820
Father!

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:41.450
For him to be able to strike
back at me from his position...

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:44.490
he just might have defeated Freeza.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:47.910
As might be expected of
Coola-sama! Nicely done!

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:53.080
This means all the Saiyans in
the world have been eliminated!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.500
Idiot!

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:58.260
After taking my destructive beam directly,

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:01.930
he was able to shoot back at
me with that strong a Ki blast!

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:07.470
He's still alive. Find him immediately!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.780
Father!

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:22.780
Father!

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.570
Father!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:32.330
Damn! There's absolutely no
trace of them on the Scouter!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.920
Where did they go!?

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:37.590
Unbelievable! There's no
way he could have survived

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:40.380
after taking Coola-sama's destructive beam!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.470
He's finally coming to, huh?

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:51.680
Haiya Dragon! Oolong!
Where's Gohan and the others?

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.940
Father! Father!

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.780
Father...

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:06.320
G- Gohan...

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:07.370
Father!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:12.500
My body...

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:14.000
What's that?

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:28.260
Come on out if you're still alive, Saiyan!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.640
If you don't, we'll blow
away the whole planet!

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.530
Dammit!

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:50.080
Gohan...

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:15.600
He'd have to be some
kind of freak to still be alive!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:18.270
Still, we may have overdone it a bit here.

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:21.480
It'll be a chore just
finding his body in all this

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:24.110
He still is not dead.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:26.200
Do whatever it takes to find
him, and bring him before me.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:29.950
It would be a simple matter to
blow him and the whole planet up,

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:31.740
but my pride won't allow it.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:32.990
Y- yes!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.410
I did not come to avenge my brother,

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:42.920
but to crucify the Saiyan who took
our pride and smeared mud upon it.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.960
--You understand this, right?
--Yes!

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:52.890
Let's go!

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.100
What's the matter?

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.690
You can smell Gohan's scent?

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:05.440
Under this rock, right?

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:06.900
Gohan! Gohan!

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:08.570
Kuririn-san!

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.410
Gohan! Are you all right?

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:12.570
Yes, but as for Father...

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.580
Goku's together with you?

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:16.540
Yes, and severely injured!

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.750
Okay! I'll get these rocks
cleared away right now!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:23.340
Kuririn-san, please be careful
not to be detected by their Scouters!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:24.540
Gotcha.

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.460
You guys take care of the other animals.

00:17:26.550 --> 00:17:27.420
You got it!

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:35.890
Kuririn, I'm okay.
The animals should come first.

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:39.690
Yeah, Oolong and them are
helping them out now. Don't worry!

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.240
Kuririn!

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:52.320
Help!

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:57.620
I'm saved!

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.450
Now I've done it!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.330
There they are!

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:05.840
What the-

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:08.880
The reading came from that thing!?

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:10.550
Don't scare me like that!

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:14.640
Damn. They probably noticed that just now.

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:17.560
We have to move out from here fast.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.810
Gohan, I'll look after Goku,

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.690
you go to Karin-sama's place
and bring back some Senzu, okay?

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.480
Right!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.820
However, you can't use
the Bukujutsu technique!

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:31.700
Yes, I know. I can leave that
up to Haiya Dragon here, right?

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:34.320
That's a good boy, Gohan!
We're counting on you!

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.450
Right!

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.830
Fly as high as you can,
so you won't be seen by them!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:39.700
Right!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:42.710
We'll still be hiding around this area, okay?

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:43.960
Right!

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:51.340
At this rate, day is about to break!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.720
All right, they haven't detected us!

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:58.720
Go, Haiya Dragon!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.100
So fast, so fast! That's the way!

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.820
It's up to you, Gohan.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.950
Haiya Dragon, stick with it!

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:31.090
We can see it now! Just a little farther!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.760
Hang in there, Haiya Dragon!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.970
Thanks, Haiya Dragon!

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:42.890
I'll be back, so wait here for me, okay?

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:45.310
All right!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:52.320
Father, hold on, okay? It's almost over.

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:01.620
All right, it's coming into view!

00:20:13.590 --> 00:20:14.760
Karin-sama!

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:17.510
Karin-sama, are you here?

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.300
Can it be Goku's boy?

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:24.930
Yes. I, um, wonder if you could
share some of your Senzu with me.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:28.690
You started climbing Karin-Tower
from midway up, didn't you?

00:20:28.770 --> 00:20:30.940
Cheating, we cannot have cheating.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:32.610
You will do it over.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.860
Um, but Father is seriously injured, and...

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:38.700
Very well.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:41.030
I'll climb up once again.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:43.790
Aay, kid!

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:46.830
Take this with ya!

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:47.870
What's this?

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:50.460
Senzu, of course!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.630
Yajirobe!

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:54.130
Don't go 'round bein' so strict,
you stubborn ol' geezer!

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.130
What did you say!?

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:58.220
You're the one who keeps
eating my food as you please!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.550
That's got nothin' to do wit' this, yeah?

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:01.930
Um, what about these?

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:07.270
Well, in light of your honesty, I'll
make a special exception this time.

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:09.770
You were fixin' to do so from
the beginnin', weren'cha?

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:11.270
You just hush!

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:14.150
Thank you ever so much!

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:17.360
I will never forget your
kindness as long as I live!

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:20.530
Here comes...

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:25.120
Kid, take this one too!

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:29.290
Thank you very much!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.540
I didn't give him even a single one!

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:35.210
Ain't that one of the nicer things about'cha?

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.800
If you'll excuse me...

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:43.850
Haiya Dragon!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:48.390
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:21:48.480 --> 00:21:50.770
All right, let's hurry to where Father is!

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:52.650
Haiya Dragon, hang in there!

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:59.780
Goku has been blessed
with a good son, huh?

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:07.660
Haiya Dragon, stay with it!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:14.170
Goku!

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:16.250
Goku!

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:18.260
Goku!!

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.840
It's okay, I'm still alive.

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:27.510
Goku, Gohan will be
coming back right away, okay?

00:22:27.600 --> 00:22:28.970
Hang in there for me!

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:30.100
Yeah...

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:36.980
Gohan, please hurry!

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:40.320
Hey, it's morning now!

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:42.200
Can he really be alive!?

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:44.530
Are we sure he hasn't been blown apart!?

00:22:45.870 --> 00:22:48.830
Haiya Dragon, just a little more!

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.670
Hang in there! We're almost there!

00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:59.500
I know!

00:22:59.590 --> 00:23:01.460
Here, eat this.

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:13.980
How fast, how fast!

00:23:15.940 --> 00:23:17.310
There he is!

00:23:18.110 --> 00:23:21.070
Way to go, way to go, Haiya Dragon!

00:23:22.360 --> 00:23:25.320
Kid! You're alive after all, are you?

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:26.870
Whoops!

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:28.910
His power rose too high from that Senzu!

00:23:44.970 --> 00:23:46.090
Haiya Dragon!

00:23:58.360 --> 00:24:00.270
This brat is holding on to something!

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:04.360
Hey, what have you got here? Give it to me!

00:24:05.950 --> 00:24:08.820
Oh, well. I'll just kill you as-is.

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:17.420
Dore!

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:19.040
W- who's there!?

00:24:23.380 --> 00:24:25.170
A Namekian?

00:24:26.800 --> 00:24:28.890
Now some other weird
guy has come forward!

00:24:28.970 --> 00:24:31.680
Gohan! Hurry and deliver those Senzu!

00:24:31.760 --> 00:24:33.850
P- Piccolo-san!

00:24:33.930 --> 00:24:36.690
You're going to pay for this!

00:24:36.770 --> 00:24:40.270
So, you appear to be somewhat capable.

00:24:40.360 --> 00:24:42.020
Don't you mock me!

00:24:56.960 --> 00:25:00.290
Gohan, what are you doing!?

00:25:00.380 --> 00:25:02.710
Hurry up and go!

00:25:02.800 --> 00:25:04.880
Right! Thank you, Piccolo-san!

00:25:04.960 --> 00:25:08.090
You rat! You're not getting away!

00:25:16.350 --> 00:25:17.390
You fool!

00:25:19.770 --> 00:25:20.850
Dore, behind you!

00:25:20.940 --> 00:25:21.810
What!?

00:25:42.380 --> 00:25:45.090
I'll just take this and...

00:25:51.800 --> 00:25:54.640
Dore!! Why, you!

00:25:59.350 --> 00:26:02.270
Sauzer!

00:26:02.350 --> 00:26:03.560
Take this!

00:26:08.360 --> 00:26:10.860
All right, Naise,
I'll leave the rest for you!

00:26:10.950 --> 00:26:13.070
Kid, you're not getting away!

00:26:14.370 --> 00:26:16.910
You're finished now!

00:26:17.950 --> 00:26:20.710
So, how many more
seconds will you last?

00:26:20.790 --> 00:26:22.000
Good question.

00:26:37.930 --> 00:26:39.720
Why, you...

00:26:40.770 --> 00:26:42.140
Dammit!

00:27:33.950 --> 00:27:34.900
What!?

00:27:39.950 --> 00:27:41.700
You rotten...

00:27:41.790 --> 00:27:42.870
Sauzer!

00:27:42.960 --> 00:27:44.620
You go after the kid!

00:28:00.350 --> 00:28:01.810
Freeza...

00:28:05.940 --> 00:28:08.520
Gohan's sure taking a long time.

00:28:10.360 --> 00:28:12.820
Goku, hang in there!

00:28:12.900 --> 00:28:14.530
Kuririn-san!

00:28:14.610 --> 00:28:16.240
Gohan!

00:28:16.320 --> 00:28:17.610
Father!

00:28:17.700 --> 00:28:19.030
Where's Haiya Dragon?

00:28:19.120 --> 00:28:22.740
We were spotted by those guys,
and he fell away from me!

00:28:22.830 --> 00:28:25.000
But the Senzu are here!

00:28:25.080 --> 00:28:28.210
You did great! Now Goku will be okay!

00:28:28.290 --> 00:28:31.250
G- Gohan, I owe you one...

00:28:31.340 --> 00:28:34.210
I'm going to go look for Haiya Dragon now!

00:28:34.300 --> 00:28:36.670
Okay! Leave the rest to us!

00:28:40.720 --> 00:28:43.140
So this is where you were, huh?

00:28:43.220 --> 00:28:45.810
Oh no, I was followed!

00:28:46.440 --> 00:28:51.520
Damn it all, we were
so close! You bastard!

00:28:51.610 --> 00:28:53.980
If only you hadn't come along!

00:28:56.950 --> 00:28:59.110
Is this as far as it goes?

00:29:00.120 --> 00:29:01.910
Aw, crap!

00:29:03.490 --> 00:29:05.450
Kid, take this one too!

00:29:06.460 --> 00:29:07.910
Here it is!

00:29:08.000 --> 00:29:09.920
Father, here!

00:29:10.000 --> 00:29:12.840
G- Gohan, what's this?

00:29:12.920 --> 00:29:14.960
It's okay, just eat it!

00:29:20.510 --> 00:29:21.470
Dammit!

00:29:32.560 --> 00:29:33.900
Kuririn-san!

00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:36.030
How could you!?

00:29:38.280 --> 00:29:39.450
Lousy brat!

00:29:42.570 --> 00:29:45.280
Who do you guys think you are?

00:29:45.370 --> 00:29:48.960
Now then, to finish off
the remaining scum...

00:29:49.040 --> 00:29:51.120
This will be a cinch.

00:30:01.180 --> 00:30:03.720
What's with this reading?

00:30:03.800 --> 00:30:06.640
Its power is rising rapidly!

00:30:07.520 --> 00:30:08.890
That's impossible!

00:30:08.980 --> 00:30:11.940
There's not supposed to be
anyone like this inside there!

00:30:12.980 --> 00:30:14.650
What the hell is it?

00:30:28.790 --> 00:30:31.080
G- Goku...

00:30:33.380 --> 00:30:34.330
Kuririn!

00:30:35.960 --> 00:30:38.920
F- Father...

00:30:39.380 --> 00:30:40.510
Gohan!

00:30:40.590 --> 00:30:42.550
You... how!?

00:30:45.800 --> 00:30:48.260
This is impossible!

00:30:48.350 --> 00:30:50.890
You ain't any match for me.

00:30:50.980 --> 00:30:53.270
Go back to your own planet immediately!

00:30:53.350 --> 00:30:57.770
Oh, you've finally come
out, have you, Saiyan?

00:30:57.860 --> 00:30:58.860
Coola-sama!

00:31:02.950 --> 00:31:05.320
Is this guy one of your friends, too?

00:31:05.910 --> 00:31:07.950
Piccolo!

00:31:09.500 --> 00:31:13.120
You're such a fool! To just
wander on out here on your own!

00:31:13.210 --> 00:31:15.790
If only that Namekian hadn't
stuck up for that brat of yours,

00:31:15.880 --> 00:31:20.960
he wouldn't have had to go through this!

00:31:21.050 --> 00:31:22.090
Catch!

00:31:51.950 --> 00:31:53.290
You rotten...

00:31:53.370 --> 00:31:56.750
Because of me, you've
beaten up even Piccolo!?

00:31:57.960 --> 00:32:02.300
A Saiyan, born only to
fight, has such sentiment?

00:32:02.380 --> 00:32:04.970
I am a Saiyan who was raised on Earth!

00:32:08.970 --> 00:32:11.680
So you were that kid from back then.

00:32:11.770 --> 00:32:13.140
Why, you...!

00:32:14.940 --> 00:32:21.270
So, show me this so-called
Super Saiyan power of yours!

00:32:21.360 --> 00:32:22.900
You're going to pay!

00:32:40.790 --> 00:32:42.920
I won't be taken the way my brother was.

00:33:26.970 --> 00:33:29.470
Hmph, you do as well as I expected.

00:33:29.550 --> 00:33:32.890
Enough to have defeated my brother.

00:33:32.970 --> 00:33:36.680
However, the real hell begins now!

00:33:36.770 --> 00:33:42.860
Once you witness this hell, I will show
you no mercy, no matter how you scream!

00:33:42.940 --> 00:33:45.520
Not until I've torn you to bits.

00:33:48.780 --> 00:33:50.740
One time more.

00:33:52.740 --> 00:33:58.700
I am able to transform myself
one time more than my brother.

00:33:58.790 --> 00:33:59.870
What!?

00:33:59.960 --> 00:34:02.250
You should consider this an honor.

00:34:02.330 --> 00:34:07.800
You will be the first to see my
ultimate transformation, and the last!

00:34:37.370 --> 00:34:42.460
Incredible...
His Ki is even greater than Freeza's!

00:34:50.970 --> 00:34:53.880
So, shall we begin?

00:35:41.770 --> 00:35:43.850
Just what I'd expect from a Saiyan!

00:36:08.960 --> 00:36:10.040
What's wrong?

00:36:10.130 --> 00:36:13.510
Is this the extent of a Super Saiyan's power?

00:36:58.800 --> 00:37:00.800
I find you entertaining!

00:37:20.780 --> 00:37:22.160
What!?

00:37:37.970 --> 00:37:40.050
Hmph, how dull!

00:37:40.140 --> 00:37:45.850
Super Saiyans only exist in
legends after all, I guess.

00:37:45.930 --> 00:37:50.850
I'm going to turn you, together with
this whole planet, into space dust!

00:37:50.940 --> 00:37:54.150
There is no one in the world
that can stand against me!

00:37:56.780 --> 00:37:59.030
I am the strongest in the universe!

00:38:08.960 --> 00:38:11.120
What's going on!?

00:38:18.380 --> 00:38:20.550
G- Goku...

00:38:21.220 --> 00:38:23.390
F- Father...

00:38:23.970 --> 00:38:26.970
Kuririn... Gohan...

00:38:29.350 --> 00:38:30.980
Piccolo...

00:38:43.780 --> 00:38:49.450
I'm sorry, everyone...
this is all because of me...

00:39:17.940 --> 00:39:21.030
What's this!? What's going on here!?

00:39:23.950 --> 00:39:25.530
What is this change?

00:39:30.950 --> 00:39:32.540
I'll finish you off!

00:39:34.960 --> 00:39:38.790
That's enough. How dare
you mess up this planet!

00:39:41.970 --> 00:39:45.800
How many planets will you guys have
to destroy before you're satisfied?

00:39:47.800 --> 00:39:48.970
Impossible!

00:39:52.350 --> 00:39:57.060
I'm not forgiving you any more, even
if you do apologize, you scumbag!!

00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:17.710
I see! This is why
my brother was no match for you!

00:40:17.790 --> 00:40:18.880
However...

00:40:34.560 --> 00:40:35.930
That was careless, huh!?

00:40:36.020 --> 00:40:38.690
I told you I was different
from my brother, didn't I!?

00:40:38.770 --> 00:40:42.150
You and your planet, vanish into oblivion!!

00:41:01.380 --> 00:41:07.260
You fool! I'd like to say that you'd done
well, but I am the strongest in the universe!

00:41:11.810 --> 00:41:15.560
I- I ain't going to let this fall to Earth!

00:41:27.950 --> 00:41:29.860
This is the end of this planet!

00:41:29.950 --> 00:41:33.660
What's more, the Saiyans will
also now disappear from this world!

00:41:56.930 --> 00:41:58.100
What!?

00:42:08.780 --> 00:42:12.740
I will not be defeated by the likes of this!

00:42:23.960 --> 00:42:25.630
What!?

00:42:35.970 --> 00:42:38.770
Coola-sama, shall I shoot it down?

00:42:39.930 --> 00:42:43.480
Let it be. This is a seed he planted himself.

00:42:43.560 --> 00:42:45.860
Let him harvest it himself.

00:42:45.940 --> 00:42:50.030
Freeza is still much, much too soft.

00:42:52.360 --> 00:42:55.280
If only I had shot him down at the time...

00:42:55.370 --> 00:42:59.080
Freeza wasn't the only
one that was too soft!

00:43:44.790 --> 00:43:49.090
G- guys, I did it!

00:43:50.960 --> 00:43:51.920
Goku!

00:43:53.970 --> 00:43:55.300
Father!

00:43:55.390 --> 00:43:58.890
Y- you guys... Haiya Dragon...

00:43:58.970 --> 00:44:00.930
T- thank goodness!

00:44:02.770 --> 00:44:06.100
But Piccolo-san isn't around anywhere.

00:44:06.190 --> 00:44:09.860
Knowing him,
he'll appear unexpectedly sometime.

00:44:09.940 --> 00:44:12.030
Yes, I guess so.

00:44:16.360 --> 00:44:17.570
Piccolo-san!

00:44:34.380 --> 00:44:36.340
Die!!

00:44:48.770 --> 00:44:50.060
Piccolo-san?

00:44:53.780 --> 00:44:55.070
Piccolo-san...

00:45:00.870 --> 00:45:04.040
Piccolo-san!

00:45:13.090 --> 00:45:17.050
Piccolo-san!

00:45:22.010 --> 00:45:25.220
Help! Help! Help! Help!

00:45:25.310 --> 00:45:28.520
Help! Help! Help! Help!

00:45:29.100 --> 00:45:32.310
Help! Help! Help! Help!

00:45:33.110 --> 00:45:36.780
Help! Help! Help! Help!

00:45:36.860 --> 00:45:38.570
Help! Help!

00:45:40.990 --> 00:45:47.500
One after the next, they keep coming at me,

00:45:47.580 --> 00:45:54.090
On this journey of conflict without end!

00:45:55.880 --> 00:46:02.640
One after the next, it keeps getting hotter,

00:46:02.720 --> 00:46:10.690
The blood, filled with fury, within my breast!

00:46:10.850 --> 00:46:14.480
Those of us raised here on Earth,

00:46:14.570 --> 00:46:17.900
Place our faith in you,

00:46:17.990 --> 00:46:25.490
So get back for us the smiles we have lost!

00:46:25.580 --> 00:46:26.790
Above and beyond, above and beyond!

00:46:26.870 --> 00:46:29.450
Grow stronger!

00:46:29.540 --> 00:46:30.790
Above and beyond, above and beyond!

00:46:30.870 --> 00:46:32.790
Rise above the rest!

00:46:32.880 --> 00:46:39.630
It's time now to rouse up the mightiest wind!

00:46:40.880 --> 00:46:41.970
Above and beyond, above and beyond!

00:46:42.050 --> 00:46:44.390
Take those that are strong,

00:46:44.470 --> 00:46:45.800
Above and beyond, above and beyond!

00:46:45.890 --> 00:46:48.060
And give them a sound beating!

00:46:48.140 --> 00:46:52.980
It's time now to put it to the
test, your mightiest power!
